title: Bachmann BlueNet2: GPIO sensor state
agents: snmp
catalog: hw/power/bachmann
license: GPLv2
distribution: kuhn-ruess
description:
 Monitors the state of the GPIO sensor modules (internal and external) of
 all PDUs of a Bachmann BlueNet2 chain, as reported by the master.

 {on}, {ok} are {OK}. {expected} (configured, but not present, e.g. because
 the PDU it is attached to is down), {off}, {lost}, the alarm and error
 states are {CRIT}, the warning states, {disabled} and {updateInProgress}
 are {WARN}, unknown states are {UNKNOWN}. A sensor that vanished from the
 SNMP data is {CRIT}.

item:
 The name of the PDU followed by the name of the sensor, e.g.
 {Slave-2 GPIO Internal}.

discovery:
 One service per GPIO sensor. The service label {device_friendly_name}
 holds the friendly name of the PDU.
